# Multimmit (50 Validators, 50 Producers, 32KiB Transaction Blocks)

## Every producer disseminates one transaction block. This overlaps consensus and models aggregate
## chain-layer load; DA shares and certificates continue in the background and are omitted.
broadcast{0, size=32768}

## The correct leader disseminates its leader block and referenced V-QC. The sizes interpolate the
## paper's K=40 and K=100 good-case estimates to K=50.
propose{1, size=11500}
propose{2, size=15000}

## Every validator receives both leader artifacts and disseminates one ordinary vote. The vote size
## is the paper's upper estimate for K=50 with two extensions on every chain.
wait{1, threshold=1} && wait{2, threshold=1}
broadcast{3, size=3500}

## Each validator finalizes locally after receiving n-f votes. For n>=5f+1, resilience=5 computes
## f=floor((n-1)/5), so 50 validators require 41 votes.
wait{3, threshold=n-f, resilience=5}
